# Ephemeris data is fetched, never committed.
#
# The prototype carried 301 MB of .se1 files un-ignored for 20 months, and
# sisco128/meteorite has ~117 MB of them permanently in its git history. A
# passive line here demonstrably is not enough, so .github/workflows/ci.yml
# also fails any diff that adds a *.se1 or any blob over 5 MB.
#
# To populate: pnpm ephem:fetch
/ephem/
